sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as ferrokey (UI)
    participant DR as KeyboardDriver
    participant DL as DaemonLink
    participant TERM as ferrokey-terminal
    participant SRV as ferrokeyd serve
    participant K as kernel (uinput)

    UI->>UI: drop / shutdown request
    UI->>TERM: term.shutdown() (child SIGHUP + grace)
    TERM-->>UI: ChildExit summary
    UI->>DR: release_all (no stuck keys)
    DR->>DL: RELEASE_ALL frame
    DL->>SRV: AF_UNIX
    SRV->>SRV: release held keys (ledger)
    SRV->>K: EV_KEY up for held keys
    UI-->>SRV: disconnect (EOF)
    SRV->>K: close device fd -> unregister (SEC.STATE.SIGKILL)
    SRV->>SRV: phase terminating
